### AuditTrail API — try it from Visual Studio (click "Send request" above each block).
### Start the API first (F5 in Visual Studio, or `docker compose up`). Demo keys/ids come from the seeder; they are not secrets.

@api = http://localhost:8080
@acme = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@globex = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Health: liveness (process up) and readiness (database + workers OK)
GET {{api}}/health/live

###
GET {{api}}/health/ready

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Producers (X-Api-Key)

### Ingest ONE event -> 201 (stored), repeat -> 200 Duplicate, change the payload -> 409 Conflict
POST {{api}}/api/ingest/events
X-Api-Key: acme-payments-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "http-demo-0001",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-21T10:15:30Z",
  "actor": { "type": "User", "id": "user:jdoe", "ip": "10.0.0.7" },
  "action": "payment.approved",
  "resource": { "type": "Invoice", "id": "INV-20931" },
  "outcome": "Success",
  "category": "Financial",
  "metadata": { "amount": 1250.50, "currency": "USD", "cardNumber": "4111111111111111" }
}

### Mixed batch -> 207 with a result per event (accepted / rejected / duplicate)
POST {{api}}/api/ingest/events/batch
X-Api-Key: acme-payments-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    { "eventId": "http-batch-1", "occurredAt": "2026-10-21T10:00:00Z", "actor": { "type": "Service", "id": "svc:payments" }, "action": "refund.issued", "resource": { "type": "Refund", "id": "R-1" }, "outcome": "Success", "category": "Financial" },
    { "eventId": "http-batch-2", "occurredAt": "2026-10-21T10:00:00Z", "actor": { "type": "User", "id": "user:x" }, "action": "payment.approved", "resource": { "type": "Payment", "id": "P-2" }, "outcome": "Success", "category": "NotACategory" },
    { "eventId": "http-batch-1", "occurredAt": "2026-10-21T10:00:00Z", "actor": { "type": "Service", "id": "svc:payments" }, "action": "refund.issued", "resource": { "type": "Refund", "id": "R-1" }, "outcome": "Success", "category": "Financial" }
  ]
}

### Revoked key -> 401
POST {{api}}/api/ingest/events
X-Api-Key: acme-revoked-key
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Auditors (X-Tenant-Id + X-Role)

### Search (from/to required, max 90 days). Add &cursor=<nextCursor> for the next page, &newestFirst=true for newest first.
GET {{api}}/api/events?from=2026-09-25T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-23T00:00:00Z&category=Financial&limit=5
X-Tenant-Id: {{acme}}
X-Role: Auditor

### Search without a time range -> 400 time_range_required
GET {{api}}/api/events
X-Tenant-Id: {{acme}}
X-Role: Auditor

### One event (replace the id with one from the search). Another tenant's id -> 404
GET {{api}}/api/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Tenant-Id: {{acme}}
X-Role: Auditor

### Verify the hash chain (empty body = whole chain)
POST {{api}}/api/integrity/verify
X-Tenant-Id: {{acme}}
X-Role: Auditor
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Create an export -> 202 + Location. Same Idempotency-Key again -> the same job.
POST {{api}}/api/exports
X-Tenant-Id: {{acme}}
X-Role: Auditor
Idempotency-Key: http-demo-export-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "filter": { "from": "2026-09-25T00:00:00Z", "to": "2026-10-23T00:00:00Z", "category": "Financial" }, "format": "Ndjson" }

### List exports (status, rows written, checksum)
GET {{api}}/api/exports
X-Tenant-Id: {{acme}}
X-Role: Auditor

### Tenant summary
GET {{api}}/api/summary?from=2026-05-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-23T00:00:00Z
X-Tenant-Id: {{acme}}
X-Role: Auditor

### Retention policies (Auditor can read)
GET {{api}}/api/retention/policies
X-Tenant-Id: {{acme}}
X-Role: Auditor

### Auditor tries to change retention -> 403
PUT {{api}}/api/retention/policies/Access
X-Tenant-Id: {{acme}}
X-Role: Auditor
Content-Type: application/json

{ "retentionDays": 30 }

### ComplianceAdmin creates a legal hold
POST {{api}}/api/legal-holds
X-Tenant-Id: {{acme}}
X-Role: ComplianceAdmin
X-User-Id: alice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scopeType": "Actor", "scopeValue": "user:asmith", "reason": "Investigation 2026-42" }

### ComplianceAdmin runs retention now (verifies the chain first; never deletes held events)
POST {{api}}/api/retention/run
X-Tenant-Id: {{acme}}
X-Role: ComplianceAdmin
